        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    asset_cash_flows = [500000, 300000, 200000]\n    liability_cash_flows = [400000, 250000, 150000]\n    discount_rate = 0.05\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    present_value_assets = sum(\n        cash_flow / ((1 + discount_rate) ** (period + 1))\n        for period, cash_flow in enumerate(asset_cash_flows)\n    )\n    present_value_liabilities = sum(\n        cash_flow / ((1 + discount_rate) ** (period + 1))\n        for period, cash_flow in enumerate(liability_cash_flows)\n    )\n    answer = round(present_value_assets - present_value_liabilities)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
